  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "选择拥有独特战斗风格与技能的英雄，连续挑战由元素裂隙腐化的关卡头目",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Take control of one of eight unique champions — each a master of their own combat style and skills — and fight your way through eight perilous levels , each dominated by a sub-boss corrupted by the elemental rift.",
