      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "程序化房间、随机战利品和高压敌阵要求战术判断与快速反应",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Every journey is different, with procedurally-generated rooms, randomized loot, and punishing enemy encounters that reward tactical combat and quick reflexes.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3214320/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "升级分配技能点与属性点，并从每名角色的五项专属技能中主动装备三项",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "When leveled-up, you will get a skill point and 2 stat points. You can use them in order to improve the chracter's build. Every character has 5 unique special skills. But you can only use 3 of them actively.",
